#HELPS
-1 GILIKAK'S_MANSION_CHANGES~
07.19.99 Quest cheats removed
08.19.99 Debugging
04.15.01 Fixed Wyrm EQ OProgs - Yosho
07.25.01 Wyrm EQ/Mob now checks for evil alignment
10.12.03 quests separated? - Yosho
10.12.03 wyrm mob checks for troll, voracious creature purge fixed?, eq loads for monks - Oz
03.18.09 - Fixed an issue where if a char begs the wyrm the wyrm would say he would forgive then
           immediately attack.  The wyrm now says he will forgive only once.  He will attack if
           that char begs him again. (Order)
03.18.09 - Fixed an issue that caused [*****] BUG: Mob: 11319 bad argument to 'position'.
           The line was - if position (self) != 7
           Changed to   - if position ($i) != 7 (Order)
03.18.09 - Fixed an issue that caused [*****] BUG: Mob: 11325 bad argument to 'position'.
           The line was - if position(self) != 6
           Changed to   - if position($i) != 6 (Order)
03.20.09 - Fixed an issue with the Rune Etched Quest where they Wyrm would send you to retrieve
           equipment from either Caine or Corwin and would not respond unless you gave him the
           opposite piece of equipment. (Order)
~
-1 GILIKAK MANSION GILIKAKS~

Gilikak was a hero in the old wars of Order vs. Chaos.  He was killed in a  
struggle with chaos and was granted eternal life by Order for his services.
He wanders the halls of his magnificent mansion plotting revenge.  His
personal bard Jonathon stays within the mansion
telling visitors the tale of his liege lord.

MRTERM users should download externals before attempting any quests, to
reduce external download lag.

{170}Created 5-95 Hupster {120}Revision 3-98 Hupster/Picard.
~
-1 HELP_BEAT~
{770}The ghostly executioner shakes the prisoner violently,
beating his head against the stone chopping block.
~
-1 HELP_CREAM~
{170}You reach out and spread the cream on your face.
~
-1 HELP_MIST1~
{170}You are enveloped by a cloud of mist and cannot see a thing until the 
haze slowly clears.
~
-1 HELP_EQ1~
{130}The wyrm scale arm guards vibrate wildly for a moment before they 
disappear and are replaced by a small black hole.
~
-1 HELP_EQ2~
{130}The large wyrm scale vibrates wildly for a moment before it disappears 
and is replaced by a small black hole.
~
-1 HELP_EQ3~
{130}The wyrm bone vibrates wildly for a moment before it disappears and is 
replaced by a small black hole.
~
-1 HELP_EQ4~
{130}The wyrm liver vibrates wildly for a moment before it disappears and is 
replaced by a small black hole.
~
-1 HELP_EQ5~
{130}The loop of wyrm cartilage vibrates wildly for a moment before it 
disappears and is replaced by a small black hole.
~
-1 HELP_EQ6~
{130}The length of wyrm entrails vibrates wildly for a moment before it 
disappears and is replaced by a small black hole.
~
-1 HELP_EVIL_CHANGE~
{101}You feel a dark cloud settle upon your soul.
~
-1 HELP_EYE1~
{130}By blinding the monster he cannot see too attack you. 
{130}You toss the blinded eyeball aside.
~
-1 HELP_GILI_ATTACK1~
{170}The air around you becomes thick and heavy with building energy.
~
-1 HELP_GILI_ATTACK2~
{110}The air around you condenses briefly as a {770}screaming order bolt{110} 
slams into the wyrm's chest!!
~
-1 HELP_GILI_ATTACK3~
{110}The air around you condenses as a {170}screaming order bolt{110} rains 
fire from the sky!!
~
-1 HELP_IVORY1~
{170}The ivory crystals {130}glows {170}brightly for a moment.
~
-1 HELP_JAR1~
{130}You open a jar of lard and throw it at the monster. The jar breaks and 
coats the ground under the monster with the slippery lard.
~
-1 HELP_MASK1~
{130}As you slip the mask over your head the voracious monster hesitates
{130}for a moment wondering where is victim went.
~
-1 HELP_MEAT1~
{130}The voracious monster takes the rotten meat and after devouring it begins 
to look a little {120}green{130}.
~
-1 HELP_GILI_LEAVE~
{770}The ghost of Gilikak disappears within a bright flash of light.
~
-1 HELP_GILI_RESTORE~
{110}Order restores his champion.
~
-1 HELP_GILI_RESTORE1~
{130}Order gives new life to his champion.
~
-1 HELP_GILI_RUSH~
{171}Gilikak rushes into the room ahead of you.
~
-1 HELP_JOCE_FAZE~
{770}Lady Jocelyn fazes reality and disappears.
~
-1 HELP_STICK1~
{130}You wave the stick wildly in front of the monster distracting him while 
you dodge his attacks.
~
-1 HELP_STOP1~
{130}You hastily draw a large octagon with large block letters spelling
{110}S{170}T{110}O{170}P{130} upon the paper and hold it up for the monster to see.
~
-1 HELP_SWORD_GLOW~
The sword {170}glows {300}brighter as it absorbs {170}energy {300}from your surroundings.
~
-1 HELP_TEAR~
A tear falls from his cheek and {770}vaporizes{300} before it hits the ground.
~
-1 HELP_TOKEN_CHAOS~
The sword god-slayer can be temporarily enchanted for those that wish to do so.

{110}Chaos {300}followers may use the command {170}jin-mak'a'suno {300}to temporarily enchant 
the god-slayer for use against your order enemies.  To see if the god-slayer 
can be used in this manner use the command{130}worship{300} to check on its status.
~
-1 HELP_TOKEN_CHAOS1~
{150}As you call upon the power of {110}Chaos{150},
the god-slayer sword begins to {730}glow {150}extremely bright.
~
-1 HELP_TOKEN_ORDER~
The sword god-slayer can be temporarily enchanted for those that wish to do so.
{110}Order{300} followers may use the command {170}oj-koti'juno{300} to temporarily 
enchant the god-slayer for use against your chaos enemies.  To see if the 
god-slayer can be used in this manner use the command {130}worship{300} to check on its status.
~
-1 HELP_TOKEN_ORDER1~
{150}As you call upon the power of {170}Order{150},
the god-slayer sword begins to {730}glow {150}extremely bright.
~
-1 HELP_TOOTH1~
{171}The blood of your enemy oozes out of their wound.
~
-1 HELP_TOOTH2~
{117}The wyrm tooth has become stained with the blood of your enemy.
~
-1 HELP_VOR1~
{130}The voracious monster looks around like he is lonely for monster company.
 ~
-1 HELP_VOR2~
{130}The voracious monster claws at the ground wildly before charging you.
 ~
-1 HELP_VOR3~
{130}The monsters eyeball pivots in your hand too look at you intently.
~
-1 HELP_VOR4~
{130}The monster becomes distracted from the glint and sudden movements of your armor.
~
-1 HELP_VOR5~
{130}The monster rubs his tummy in hunger perhaps ready to eat you.
~
-1 HELP_VOR6~
{130}The monster has a quick flash of intelligence as it recites a scroll
of haste.
~
-1 HELP_VOR_SMALL~
{120}The monster shrinks in size slightly.
~
-1 HELP_WITS1~
{130}A bright candle flame appears above your head.
~
-1 HELP_WYRM_ATTACK1~
{717}The Great Wyrm extends a huge claw slashing his victim horribly.
~
-1 HELP_WYRM_ATTACK2~
{110}The Great Wyrm's chest expands and deflates rapidly as a {770}HUGE {110}plume of fire envelopes you!
~
-1 HELP_WYRM_DARK~
{703}The Great Wyrm begins to chant a dark ritual.
~
-1 HELP_WYRM_LEAVE~
{770}The Great Wyrm disappears with a flash of light.
~
