AFF_INVISIBLE|AFF_HIDE
200 S
65 BODY_HEAD BODY_WING|BODY_CLAW 1d1+2582 1d1+51
3000 415376
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>greet_prog 99~
if ispc($n)
  bow
endif
~
>rand_prog 5~
  mpecho $I staggers up against the wall,
  mpecho and suddenly drops all the dishes he was carrying!
  mpforce all external GLASS.WAV
  mpasound You hear a tray of dishes clatter on the ground.
  mpasound A loud voice booms out, "Ahh fork it all!"
  mpecho $I mutters to himself as he sweeps up the broken pottery.
~
