#11301
ghost maid dead young maid_quest_mob~
The ghostly maid~
The silhouette of a young dead maid is hovering here.~
~
ACT_SCAVENGER|ACT_BODY|ACT_SMART
AFF_INVISIBLE|AFF_HIDE|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_TONGUES
100 S
65 BODY_LEG BODY_EYE|BODY_TAIL 1d1+2470 1d1+56
4000 415376
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_FEMALE
>greet_prog 69~
  bow
  tell $n May I be of service milord?
~
>speech_prog service~
  say What would you have of me milord?
  mpforce $n tum
  mpmset self quest 0 4 1
~
>rand_prog 75~
if quest(0,4,self) == 1
  say You are hungry milord?
  smile
  say I will bring you food and drink.
  mpmset self quest 0 4 2
  break
endif
if quest(0,4,self) == 2
  mpecho $I arrives with a large plate of food, and a bottle of vintage wine.
  bow
  mpquiet on
  cast "feast"
  mpquiet off
  mpecho You sit down and begin to eat the meal that the maid has brought for you.
  mpmset self quest 0 4 3
  break
endif
if quest(0,4,self) == 3
  mpecho You rise after finishing the meal that the maid has brought for you.
  mpmset self quest 0 4 4
  break
endif
if quest(0,4,self) == 4
  say If that is all milord, I will be on my way.
  bow
  mpmset self quest 0 4 0
  break
endif
~
>speech_prog no~
  bow
  tell $n As you wish milord.
~
|
