#11303
ghost girl dead_quest_mob~
A ghostly girl~
The silhouette of a young dead girl is playing here.~
~
ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY
AFF_INVISIBLE|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_HIDE|AFF_TONGUES
200 S
70 BODY_HIP BODY_MOUTH|BODY_CLAW 1d1+3579 4d10+41
10000 468961
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_FEMALE
>greet_prog 99~
if quest(0,4,$n) == 1
  smile
  tell $n Hi!  Did you see that poor man?
  tell $n He sure is in a lot of trouble.
  tell $n I never get into trouble.
  ponder
  tell $n I wonder what he is in jail for.
  mpecho $I suddenly looks very upset.
  cry $n
  tell $n If you find my doll, please give it to me....I miss it so much.
  mpmset $n quest 0 4 2
else
  smile
  tell $n Hiya!
endif
~
>rand_prog 30~
if quest(0,4,$r) <= 1
  tell $n Have you seen my doll?
  pout
endif
~
>give_prog i11320~
if quest(0,4,$n) == 4
  gasp
  say Oh thank you!
  say You are so nice!
  say You should see that giving face of yours in a mirror.
  smile  
  mppurge i11320
  mpmset $n quest 0 4 5
  mpmset self quest 1 3 1
endif
~
>death_prog 100~
if actorhasobjnum(30900)
or actorhasobjnum(30966)
or actorhasobjnum(30967)
or actorhasobjnum(30968)
or actorhasobjnum(30969)
  if quest(30,1,$n) == 0
    mpmset $n quest 30 1 1
    mpoload 30914
    mpforce $n HELP GUILDTOKEN
    mpquiet on
    c 'giant strength' $n
    give i30914 $n
    mpquiet off
  endif
endif
~
