>speech_prog legacy~
if quest(0,6,self) == 1
  mpecho $I takes in a big breath.
  say A long time ago when the gods were at war.
  say I was chosen to be the champion of Order.
  say We fought many battles but the war was far from over. 
  say After many years the forces of good pushed Chaos into Chakkor.
  mpecho Gilikak breaths deeply.
  say In the final battle of good vs. evil, I was faced with the
  say challenge of killing a god.  It was a long struggle, 
  say blow and counter blow.
  say I was poised to deal Chaos death when he blasted my mind with
  say negative energy.
  mpecho Gilikak begins to sob.
  mpforce all help help_tear
  say It was too powerful, I was killed.  
  say Order granted me eternal life for my service but, un-dead life
  say is a curse!
  mpecho Gilikak spits on the ground before of you.
  mpecho Gilikak composes himself.
  say Continue my battle $r, and may Order guide you along safe paths.
  say Take reason into your heart and cleanse the chaos that is
  say suffocating our land.
  mpmset self quest 0 6 0
endif
~
