>speech_prog yes wyrm~
if quest(7,3,$n) == 4
  say Well then have a seat.
  mpoload 11331
  mpquiet on
  cast "giant strength" $n
  give gili_chit $n
  mpquiet off
  mpmset $n quest 7 3 5
  say Long ago, before the great war, I was a young chap
  say and entering the Legion of Reason.
  sigh
  say Well, I had this lady friend... and... Huh? 
  say Mrs. Gilikak?  She is my second wife. Where was I?
  say My friend and I did what couples do.
  nudge $r
  grin
  say Later, far from home fighting the legions of Chaos,
  say I learned Lady Jocelyn was heavy with my child.
  smile
  say I was so ecstatic with joy that on that very day I 
  say became a hero of sorts at the Battle of Ofcol Hill.
  say Nothing could hold me back.  Chaos' minions fell
  say before me.  I was on top of the world.
  mpecho Gilikak looks away from you.  A pained look on his face.
  say I received word my bride had birthed premature.
  say She had given her life birthing a foul creature.
  say Chaos could not defeat me so he mutated my child.
  cry
  say I invested much effort into raising the creature.
  say He was a bright child and a wonderful son.  
  say But soon I was called back into service.
  say I was forced to neglect my duty as a father and 
  say Zanthgiltor went astray without guidance.
  say The Wyrm caused mayhem throughout the lands.
  say I was force to cage him though it pained me.
  mpecho Gilikak's eyes fill with regret.
  say That is how you found him.  Caged and angry.
  sigh
  say Oh Jocelyn, do you even know your child's name?  
endif
