>speech_prog temple~
say You want to know about the temple?
say Well, let's see...
say Long ago, Order created a haven for his devout followers.
say After the tragic death of Gilikak the God of Reason took
say all of the refugees he managed to save from the clutches
say of Chaos' minions and placed them in charge of this haven.
say No one knows the location of this safe haven.
ponder
say I seem to have forgotten the rest of the tale.
say It's been ages you know.
say I told my son the tale and he in turn has told his son.
say No one shall forget the tale of Gilikak's great sacrifice.
say If you ever run across one of my relatives, let them know
say I am doing fine.
smile
say Aye, I am doing just fine.
