>speech_prog p remove shroud~
if level($n) <= 80
  say So $n, You wish to be true to your nature?
  say I may be able to help you.
  grin
  say But first you must show me your intent is true.
  say Listen carefully and answer my questions.
  say What is your race? 
  mpmset $n quest 22 5 1
endif
~
>speech_prog human~
if quest(22,5,$n) == 1
  if race($n) == 0
    say True, but you are wrong.
    say To be evil you must be devious in your nature.
    say I ask you again, what is your race?
  else
    say False, but you are correct.
    say To be evil requires that you deal with people in a
    say underhanded and untruthful way.
    mpmset $n quest 22 5 2
    say I have another question for you.
    say If you were walking along and came across a bag of
    say gold that appeared to be without an owner, would you
    say leave it or take it?
  endif
endif
