E
painting~
The huge mural depicts a large man shining brilliantly in the late day sun. 
His gleaming white armor smeared with the blood of his enemies. His head is
held high, and his square chin is stuck out in challenge to a unknown foe. A
mass of people filter through the wake of carnage behind him as he gallantly
stands his ground.  His sword, bearing the crest of Order, is raised high
covered in the gore of the minions he has slaughtered.  A dark mass of
seething, chaotic clouds throws lightening to the ground a ways in front of
the valiant man. Looking undaunted he waves the fleeing people to safety.~
X GROOM1.MID~
